--TEST--
A `yield` inside a `finally` block is `E0255`, whether or not the `try` yields too (`rule:statements/no-return-leaves-a-finally`)
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Src {
    public static function both(): Iterator<int> {
        try {
            yield 1;
        } finally {
            yield 2;
        }
    }

    public static function onlyFinally(): Iterator<int> {
        try {
            echo "body\n";
        } finally {
            foreach (Src::both() as int $v) {
                yield $v;
            }
        }
    }
}

foreach (Src::onlyFinally() as int $v) {
    echo $v, "\n";
}
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0255]: a `yield` cannot be written inside a `finally` block
%A
7 |             yield 2;
%A
  = help: write the `yield` in the `try` block or after the whole `try` statement
%A
error[E0255]: a `yield` cannot be written inside a `finally` block
%A
16 |                 yield $v;
%A
error: aborting due to 2 errors
To read what a code means and how to fix it, run `nvs agent show <code>`.
